Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.44,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(162.339,247.666)}Traffic Saf{\c&H3C8959&}ety
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.44,Sign3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(332.025,244.999)}wi{\c&H51ADD9&}th
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.44,Sign2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(466.973,245)}Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:15.45,Credit1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(179.707,202.333)}Original Creator:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:15.45,Credit2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(445.596,203.666)}Fujiko. F. Fujio
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:15.45,Credit1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(158.33,421)}Production:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:15.45,Credit2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(418.874,422.333)}Shogakukan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.54,0:00:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going to?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To play!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And when will you do your homework?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Our playground...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.43,0:00:46.01,Credit1,,0,0,0,,{\c&H280FE3&\pos(275.909,107.666)}Construction Ongoing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:47.14,Credit2,,0,0,0,,{\frz342.8\pos(140.96,241.001)}Trucks go here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.94,0:00:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The construction has begun already!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.73,0:01:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Build what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.73,0:01:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A huge mansion is going to be built here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.69,0:01:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can't play here anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.49,0:01:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.41,0:01:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids, go home! It's dangerous here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.74,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.87,0:01:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I open my eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.71,0:01:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I open my eyes now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.00,0:01:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I open my eyes now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.97,0:01:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.93,0:01:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't find me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.27,0:01:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Found you, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.86,0:01:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't really play hide and seek here in the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.07,0:01:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's switch our places.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.82,0:01:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play catch-ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.78,0:01:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! We came here first!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:02:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a problem with that? You jerk...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.41,0:02:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.83,0:02:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.45,0:02:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.10,0:02:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I fled from Giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.81,0:02:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the usual fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.52,0:02:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What a mean thing for you to say that, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.15,0:02:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,An accident, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant's late again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.37,0:02:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I start taking roll no.\N  I have a sad news for all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.83,0:03:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Gouda Takeshi-{\i1}kun{\i0} had an accident yesterday and he's been now hospitalised.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.59,0:03:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Around what time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.38,0:03:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Around 5:00 PM at the flowershop near your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.14,0:03:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I was fleeing from Giant then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.97,0:03:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that he...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what? Giant had an accident yesterday when he was chasing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.08,0:03:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What now, Doraemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go visit him in the hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:04:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant, there's no need to hide your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's totally uncool of me to show my face to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care weather you're acting cool at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.89,0:04:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg of you, please leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.02,0:04:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant, we're but your friends, so please show us your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.89,0:04:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,An accident? A girl's doll had an accident it seems. She was crying and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.75,0:04:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What? A doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.75,0:04:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But it should be a fat boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No, A doll! I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.55,0:04:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.96,0:04:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I know, about an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.88,0:04:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's totally confusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.59,0:04:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's use that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.80,0:04:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.81,0:05:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Time TV~!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.35,0:05:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll use Time TV to see what happened exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.11,0:05:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.41,0:05:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I found you, Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.91,0:05:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hiding under there dangerously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Time TV shows authentic footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's now me and GIant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.50,0:05:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.15,0:05:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.07,0:06:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How reckless of you to do that, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.45,0:06:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I absolutely had no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,GIant hadn't got into an accident yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.95,0:06:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about that girl's doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's forward a little ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.21,0:06:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, be careful, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My doll fell on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.30,0:06:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, big brother will pick it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:06:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.57,0:07:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.41,0:07:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So that's what really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.37,0:07:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So Nobita caused this accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.13,0:07:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.13,0:07:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, let's go apologize to the little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.93,0:07:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we should, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki-{\i1}chan{\i0}, stop crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.27,0:07:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But my doll has been torn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum will get you a new one, so please...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I need Rumi-{\i1}chan{\i0} stitched.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.36,0:07:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.65,0:07:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.91,0:07:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor for your daughter's doll, Auntie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.07,0:07:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll treat Rumi-{\i1}chan{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:07:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.29,0:07:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Healing Megaphone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll now heal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! Rumi-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.09,0:08:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.55,0:08:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mummy, Rumi-{\i1}chan{\i0} spoke to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.81,0:08:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you crashed into her yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I didn't see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.31,0:08:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to hold her hands and she held onto her doll..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.53,0:08:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum, let's visit the boy who tried to give me back my doll, in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.37,0:08:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, he must be missing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.37,0:08:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.13,0:08:55.05,Credit2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(330.688,53)}Sign: {\pos(348.058,307.667)}Limit the {\c&H3938A3&}Speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.67,0:09:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you saw the events using Time TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.80,0:09:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It was very uncool of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really. You tried your best to retrieve the doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.47,0:09:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.19,0:09:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really. It's my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.64,0:09:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We should not have fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.07,0:09:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.61,0:09:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.69,0:09:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, I've brought you a cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.03,0:09:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to get hurt in a while, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.53,0:09:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get better if you eat the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.54,0:09:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's conduct an experiment after you've been released.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,An experiment?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.56,0:09:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready? Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.67,0:10:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It hit, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.01,0:10:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't easily put brake in the vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.63,0:10:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If it was a little early, it'd have been burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.26,0:10:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, do you have a gadget that ensues one's safety?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.31,0:10:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I don't have such a gadget!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You all have to follow the traffic etiquette so that you can be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:10:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.73,0:11:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm off to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.30,0:11:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.63,0:11:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're ok, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.72,0:11:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nobita. Let's switch our places.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.59,0:11:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo, thanks for carrying me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.18,0:11:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My butt hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant, didn't your right leg got hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.30,0:12:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm glad that all of you are properly following the traffic rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.08,0:13:02.50,OF,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\pos(325.344,97)}The End
